WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.312
Volume I: The Accountability Ledger.

00:00:03.262 --> 00:00:11.450
When a state turns its sovereign power against its most vulnerable citizens, the immediate reflex of the bureaucracy is obfuscation.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:17.800
Bureaucracies do not willingly confess to systemic failure, much less to programmed liquidation.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:27.250
The evidence must be dragged from their servers, cross-referenced against their own contradictory claims, and presented with absolute mathematical rigidity.
